SUMMARY:Waterpark Simulator | Ep. 1 - Welcome to the Waterpark, Waivers
 Are by the Entrance
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new series begins! We're opening the gates to our very
 own waterpark, and I'm sure absolutely everything has been inspected
 properly. Grab your swimwear, sign the waiver, and please don't ask who
 installed the waterslides. Dive into the fun of running your very own
 waterpark! Design and expand your park, build exciting pools and
 attractions, keep your guests happy, and deal with the chaos that comes
 with managing a busy summer destination. From creating the perfect
 waterpark to handling the unexpected, it's time to see if we can turn our
 park into the ultimate place for fun in the sun.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tFlu5eGE-4
CATEGORIES:Waterpark Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24362211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260808T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T110200Z
DTSTART:20260829T203000Z
DTEND:20260829T223000Z
SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 60 - Going Where Todd Howard Never Intended
DESCRIPTION:Sixty episodes into Fallout 4, and apparently the Commonwealth
 still hasn't learned to keep me contained. Tonight we're heading beyond
 sensible exploration and discovering what happens when curiosity beats
 self-preservation. As the sole survivor of Vault 111, you enter a world
 destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a fight for survival, and every
 choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and determine the fate of the
 Wasteland. Welcome home.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvRtTdKovDA
CATEGORIES:Fallout 4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
