BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24382211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260810T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T110200Z
DTSTART:20260831T203000Z
DTEND:20260831T223000Z
SUMMARY:Edge Of Evil | Ep. 1 - I'm Coming, Kitty! Please Stop Summoning
 Ancient Evil!
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new adventure begins! There's a kitty that needs our
 help, which should be simple enough. Unfortunately, there also appears to
 be some ancient supernatural evil involved. Honestly, cats really do find
 the most inconvenient places to get themselves stuck. Descend into a dark
 psychological horror adventure where the search for a lost kitten leads
 deep into an ancient pirate crypt. Explore hidden passages, disturb
 forgotten graves, solve cryptic puzzles, dig for clues and treasure, and
 defend yourself from undead shadow creatures lurking below. With an eerie
 atmosphere, immersive sound, fully voiced characters and a mystery
 surrounding a broken ancient seal, this is a journey where curiosity may
 take us far deeper than we ever intended.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Mk8buQTRPA
CATEGORIES:Edge Of Evil
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
