SUMMARY:LEGO Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge - Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Something a little different tonight! We're beginning our
 build of the iconic bridge of the U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701. Expect lots
 of LEGO, plenty of Star Trek chat, and the occasional search for one very
 specific tiny piece. Join me on camera for a very special LEGO build
 celebrating the 60th anniversary of Star Trek! We'll be building the LEGO
 Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge set 11385 together, bringing
 one of science fiction's most iconic locations to life brick by brick.
 Settle in for a relaxed build as we explore the set, chat about Star Trek,
 and see the legendary bridge of the original Enterprise gradually take
 shape. Live long and prosper!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Lego And Brickbuilding
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
