SUMMARY:LEGO Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge - Part 2
DESCRIPTION:The build continues! Tonight we'll push toward completing the
 Enterprise bridge, assuming no essential pieces have vanished into another
 dimension beneath the desk. Join me on camera for a very special LEGO
 build celebrating the 60th anniversary of Star Trek! We'll be building the
 LEGO Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge set 11385 together,
 bringing one of science fiction's most iconic locations to life brick by
 brick. Settle in for a relaxed build as we explore the set, chat about
 Star Trek, and see the legendary bridge of the original Enterprise
 gradually take shape. Live long and prosper!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Lego And Brickbuilding
